": "CAPTAIN ARGENT", "message": "Our one-time compatriot, now content to hang out in the woods and harass supply convoys. His mom would be so proud.", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Command wants us to deal with Mullen and his rebel forces. Our goal is to simply disrupt their operations and detain and disperse any forces we encounter.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN ARGENT", "message": "Which will probably just be some guys with sharp sticks and bad attitudes.", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN DURAND", "message": "We should not underestimate General Mullen. He was part of our forces, he might have a few tricks up his sleeve.", "avatar": "durand", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN ARGENT", "message": "Yeah, but we have Tucker's shiny red tanks on our side. You just cannot overestimate the power of shiny things.", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL PEARL", "message": "What's with all this radio chatter?  Why has this taken you any time at all?  Roll out, Tucker!", "avatar": "pearl", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Yes, ma'am!", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": false}], "responses": [{"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN ARGENT", "message": "Are you embarrassed Tucker? Because I\u2019ll tell you right now: I\u2019m embarrassed for you. Maybe you should go back to Boot Camp and learn how to be a soldier again.", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": true}], "responses": [{"type": "highlight", "x": 9, "y": 4, "show": true}, {"type": "createUnit", "x": 9, "y": 4, "type_": "Stealth Tank", "player": 2, "fadeIn": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN ARGENT", "message": "I'm not the only one that sees that tank, right?", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "I'm afraid not.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "removeUnit", "x": 9, "y": 4, "fadeOut": true}, {"type": "highlight", "x": 9, "y": 4, "show": false}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN ARGENT", "message": "And... I'm not the only one that saw it disappear, right?", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "I'm afraid not.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN DURAND", "message": "What was that, Tucker?  Why was it out here?", "avatar": "durand", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Hard to say.  General Pearl probably knows.  Not much slips past her.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "General Pearl.  Area secured.  Insurgent forces have been dispersed.  Team encountered an unknown armored unit with apparent cloaking ability.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL PEARL", "message": "Understood team.  Return to base ASAP.  We likely have a situation on our hands.  Watch yourselves.", "avatar": "pearl", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Understood and received, ma'am.  We're bugging out.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN ARGENT", "message": "It's about time.", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}]}]}}